{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>4-7-8 Breathe 是一款以 4 秒吸氣、7 秒屏息、8 秒呼氣節奏為核心的呼吸練習 App，適合工作間隙需要快速減壓、睡前想平靜情緒，或在重要場合前調整狀態的用戶。透過視覺動畫與觸感提示，一分鐘內即可完成一次練習，協助舒緩緊張、提升專注並改善睡眠質素。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>動畫與觸感同步引導呼吸</h2>\n<p>App 以同步動畫呈現吸氣、屏息與呼氣的節奏，波浪隨呼吸上升與下降，跟著視覺提示即可調整節奏。內置初學與標準兩種模式，並提供觸感震動回饋，閉上眼睛也能掌握呼吸。進度日曆記錄每次練習，協助建立冥想習慣，深色模式亦會自動切換。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-122-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-127-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：4-7-8 Breathe: Focus &amp; Calm</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T19:58:01.452722+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":344,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}